Posibus version of RX8E
<UL>
<LI><b>RX08-</b> is an older version of the Posibus RX08 controller.</LI>
<LI><b>l8r</b> is a somewhat newer version of the Posibus RX08 controller.</LI>
<LI><b>RX08</b> is the Posibus RX08 controller, as ordered from the board
fab.</LI>
<LI><b>RX8E</b> is a drawing of DEC's RX8E Omnibus controller.</LI>
<LI><b>RX08b</b> is a revision to address problems found in the prototype.</LI>
<LI><b>RX08c</b> is another revision to address problems found in the
prototype.</LI>
<LI><b>RX08b19</b> is the Posibus RX08 Controller as of 04/19/2005.</LI>
<LI><b>asbuilt</b> is the Posibus RX08 Controller as built, with all the
blue wires (so far).</LI>
<LI><b>RX08-8-9</b> is the 08/09/2005 version.</LI>
<LI><b>RX08-3-5-9</b> is the 03/05/2009 version.</LI>
<LI><b>kludge</b> is the schematic of the kludge daughter board being
used to debug the prototype.</LI>
<LI><b>kludge2</b> is the schematic of the kludge daughter board being
used to debug the prototype.</LI>
